+\subsection{Training Runs}
 \label{sec:runs}
 
 Run~1 uses 631 training scenes (110,929 images, including 76 night and 125 rain scenes) and 69 dev scenes (3,000 of 12,150 images). Of the training cells, 25.1\% carry a label and 37.6\% of those are positive, giving a class weight of 1.658. The estimate of 2026-10-28 put 8 epochs at about 8.8 hours, because the cache loaded at 28 images/s against 1,007 images/s for a training step. The run itself took 3.5 hours. Its dev loss fell in every epoch, so the best head is the last one, with a dev loss of 0.5562.
 
